 "notes": "All numbers transcribed from the arXiv v1 PDF text. Dates: the paper gives MJD (Table 1) and nights 'UT December 20-21, 2020'; the calendar dates in 'date_UT' were inferred by converting MJD (59203 = 2020-12-20, 59204 = 2020-12-21), not printed per star. Asymmetric errors encoded as [-lower,+upper] as printed. The paper does not report a contrast in magnitudes for detections (only percent); no contrast-in-mag for detections was computed here. The reported 'detection limit' Table 5 values for HD 5448, 11636, 28910, 29388, 48097 are after companion removal. HD 28910 limit near the companion is unreliable per Sect. 3.3. Page numbers are arXiv PDF pages, not ApJ pages. The paper does not state OiDB IDs; mapping of this paper to the OiDB collection is as given by the requester."
